# 统一 LF 行尾 —— 根治 Windows core.autocrlf 导致的 CRLF 漂移
# 所有文本文件以 LF 入库/检出（覆盖 autocrlf），docs front matter 解析不再被 CRLF 破坏。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unified-diff context uses a leading space before tabs and on empty lines.
patches/*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-space-before-tab

# 二进制与不可安全转换类型：禁止换行规范化
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wof binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.moc3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary

# 归档与原生制品：这些类型从未在仓库内做过行尾转换，声明为二进制避免
# 将来 text=auto 按内容嗅探失败时被规范化（gradle-wrapper.jar 是唯一曾被
# 依赖嗅探才保持完好的 tracked 二进制）。
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.apk binary
*.onnx binary
*.wasm binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
